<main class="flex-1"><!--$--><section class="relative hero-bg stone-grain pt-16 pb-20 md:pt-24 md:pb-28 border-b border-border overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 grid-glow opacity-60"></div><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 md:px-6 text-center"><div class="inline-block text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-gold mb-4">Export &amp; Shipping</div><h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-[1.05] max-w-4xl mx-auto">Export-Ready Egyptian Granite</h1><p class="mt-5 text-base md:text-lg text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto">International buyers, architects, and importers — Egyptian Granite by EG delivers premium granite from Egyptian ports to projects worldwide.</p></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 md:px-6 py-16 md:py-24 "><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-xs text-muted-foreground"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><a href="<?php echo esc_url(home_url('/')); ?>" class="hover:text-gold">Home</a><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6" /></svg></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-foreground">Export</span></li></ol></nav><div class="mt-10 max-w-3xl space-y-5 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed"><p class="text-foreground">Egyptian Granite by EG exports premium Egyptian granite — blocks, slabs, tiles, and cut-to-size — to architectural, commercial, and monumental projects worldwide. Quotations are issued FOB (Egyptian port) or CIF (your destination), with mixed-container loading available across granite types, finishes, and thicknesses.</p><p>Shipments depart from Egypt&#x27;s main commercial ports: <strong>Alexandria</strong>, <strong>Port Said (East and West)</strong>, and <strong>Sokhna</strong> on the Red Sea. The loading port is named in every quotation. Transit times range from roughly 7 days within the Mediterranean and Red Sea regions to 30–45 days for North America, East Asia, and Oceania.</p><p>Wooden packing for export is ISPM-15 compliant and properly fumigated. Slabs ship in heavy-duty A-frame wooden bundles with foam interleaves and corner protection; tiles pack into fumigated wooden crates; blocks load loose with hardwood dunnage. Every piece is numbered and matched to the packing list for full traceability.</p><p>Each shipment is accompanied by a commercial invoice, packing list, certificate of origin, bill of lading, and any inspection or test certificates required by your destination market. Third-party pre-shipment inspection (SGS, Bureau Veritas, Intertek) can be arranged on request.</p></div><div class="mt-12 grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4"><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border hover:border-gold/50 transition"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-check h-5 w-5 text-gold mb-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z" /><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5" /><path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4" /></svg><div class="font-display text-lg">FOB &amp; CIF Quotation Support</div><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-2">Quotes for both incoterms with full cost transparency.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border hover:border-gold/50 transition"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-earth h-5 w-5 text-gold mb-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.54 15H17a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4.54" /><path d="M7 3.34V5a